WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:09.080
Hola.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:12.760
Hi.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:14.960
Mom, Dad, hi.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.080
Are we coming in, Walt,

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:18.920
or will you keep us

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.040
standing on a doorstep?

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:22.480
Sure.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:24.040
Come in.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.200
This just feels

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.720
very unexpected.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:29.880
What do you mean unexpected?

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.600
Didn't you invite us yourself?

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.360
No.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:40.040
Come inside.
